# Cluster picker: live preview, login expired, Flux failures, namespace picker
Output docs/picker.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "rex8s pick tab"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Down
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 2s
Type "use"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "ap"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
